before:
Complete local C++ example; the app itself does not execute it:
```cpp
#include <iostream>
template<typename T>
T larger(T a, T b) {
    if (a < b) return b;
    return a;
}
int main() {
    std::cout << larger(2, 5) << '\n';
    std::cout << larger(2.5, 1.5) << '\n';
}

```

